# No internal browser testing

Do not open, drive, or screenshot this app in Cursor's internal browser. That browser cannot test this project, and this stays in force for every future session.

Do not use browser tools, CDP, device emulation, or a preview tab against the dev server or a production build.

The user tests the interface manually in their own browser and will say what to change.

Checks that stay allowed are `pnpm run ci`, requests to the PHP API, inspection of build output, and other non-browser commands.
